{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img alt=\"Nintendo Switch 2、Switch版本更新新增贈送軟體的「禮物」功能\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"504\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3eef6322565119b7aa02e74c9b28e024684a66eaff9ed9aab5767aad14f36baa/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F409b800a5ce0b888cfe20d52cd74814d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>Nintendo Switch 2、Switch版本更新新增贈送軟體的「禮物」功能</figcaption></figure><p>2026年11月10日(二)，<strong>Nintendo Switch 2</strong>與<strong>Nintendo Switch</strong>開始發布本體功能更新資料(ver.23.5.0)。<br/>新增了「<strong>贈送禮物</strong>」這項新功能。</p><h2>Switch 2、Switch新增「贈送禮物」功能！</h2><blockquote><p></p><p>[トピックス]Nintendo Switch 2 / Nintendo Switchの本体機能をバージョンアップ。新しい機能をご紹介します。<a href=\"https://t.co/U9rTWX6BSM\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://t.co/U9rTWX6BSMhttps://t.co/U9rTWX6BSM</a></p><p>— 任天堂株式会社 (@Nintendo) <a href=\"https://x.com/Nintendo/status/2119963494963613873?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">November 10, 2026</a></p></blockquote><p>新追加的「贈送禮物」，可 贈送Nintendo eShop的商品給參加家庭群組的家人 。<br/>是適合在生日或紀念日贈送軟體的功能。</p><p>獲贈的商品，可在購買時選擇為收件者的Nintendo Account所連動的本體上領取。<br/>領取方無需輸入付款資訊或下載序號。</p><h3>「贈送禮物」的使用方法</h3><figure><p><img alt=\"「贈送禮物」\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"541\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/062b9628b85b392eb474e40de40ffb3d4077a1c71b28bb9ed4568f418d323eb9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fb31f5e9d302b9dcbb3d78eb806613d00.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></figure><p></p><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/switch2-switch-update-ver-23-5-0-02.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/75daf1f13663dc5f6c7b325b5405467492429b8ef95cad41103540b9389e8d07/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F6cc823a28c74159cf4b99d4a1deaedfe.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/switch2-switch-update-ver-23-5-0-03.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/65d77300188742053810fa0e70d9f9125145ad5fe6ac89db8e24efc9b54df98d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F36ac03537d4db7baa932e713839adb89.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>在Nintendo eShop前往想贈送之商品的購買頁面，選擇「<strong>作為禮物</strong>」。<br/>選擇贈送對象、包裝顏色等後購買。</p><p><p></p><p><p></p><p></p><p></p></p></p><figure><img alt=\"以包裝狀態送達\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2bcde75f6cdc9c1b457d5952e1641d843e37cf960e94f1c16acbc2011b5a5765/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff915b7dd34ebfab7ca3fb517d134d26c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption>以包裝狀態送達</figcaption></figure><p>贈送禮物會顯示在對方的<strong>HOME選單</strong>上。<br/>若對方將多個本體與Nintendo Account連動，購買時可選擇要送達禮物的本體。</p><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/switch2-switch-update-ver-23-5-0-05.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/174eed1e82dac18dff560f3e8ba484a78330a72eb33a7fca638a7f43223e44a0/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fceebb797f3e2714550a627f071d96673.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/uploads.saigacdn.com/2026/11/switch2-switch-update-ver-23-5-0-06.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/af5dca9afe38dbdefe7a59fc2761854449aa928caa9c48e6d358f1e81c50377e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F0b8a819449ce14b3537bb4837c681333.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></p></a><p>送達的禮物， 開封後即可馬上遊玩 ！<br/>能體驗裡面裝了什麼的真實心跳感。</p><p>詳情請確認<a href=\"https://www.nintendo.com/jp/topics/article/31e57164-941c-4103-bd30-f04744073cc3\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Nintendo TOPICS</a>。</p><hr/><h4>延伸閱讀</h4><p><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/news/super-mario-party-jamboree-nintendo-switch2-edition-update-nov2026/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸《超級瑪利歐派對 空前盛會 Nintendo Switch 2 Edition ＋ 空前盛會 TV》推出免費更新！只需一份遊戲 最多4人同樂玩大富翁</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/product/familymart-pikmin-campaign-announcement/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸日本全家便利商店推出《皮克敏》活動！限定設計的 Nintendo 預付卡及周邊商品登場</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/release/stellar-blade-ns2/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸「劍星(Stellar Blade)」Nintendo Switch 2版發售！除「NieR:Automata」與「NIKKE」之外，也收錄與「魔兵驚天錄」的合作</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/event/museum-nintendo-zelda-40th-photo-spot-announcement/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸為慶祝「薩爾達傳說」40週年，「任天堂博物館」公開了「大師之劍」拍照打卡點！期間限定的燈光秀及官方圖錄也已開始販售</a><br/><a href=\"https://saiganak.com/zh/release/where-the-seeds-fall/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">🔸CygamesEdge首款作品「崩落之國」於11月5日發售！降下崩壞的世界，以地表為目標吧</a></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T13:00:47.629502+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":968,"images":7,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T08:29:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T18:18:55.194779+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:54:29.020510+00:00","content_hash":"fd21a613f5f5fca2d57cf2edc0643a6b36dd8a87106d459059eccb37eb8aaec2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}